      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091425">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091427">AVX</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091429">Shuffle the low words in xmm2/m128 based on the encoding in imm8 and store the result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1091431">VEX.256.F2.0F.WIG 70 /r ib</para>
      <para unique="1091432">VPSHUFLW ymm1, ymm2/m256, imm8</para>
